        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "This research examines small x-ray diffraction patterns of microemulsions to determine their elementary structure. NaCl concentrations were varied systematically in hopes of discovering a regular pattern. Very strong peaks were found, yet due to experimental parameters, the variation did not appear to be systematic.",
